# Temporary Git-based persistence for the SQLite state layer.
# Treat the database as strictly binary:
#   -text   -> never normalize line endings (CRLF would corrupt pages)
#   -diff   -> no textual diff attempts on a binary file
#   -merge  -> disable textual auto-merge; conflicts must be resolved
#              manually. Never silently pick one DB side over another.
data/factory.db binary
